| `dev/release/fixtures/cargo-skew/mock-skew-consumer-a/Cargo.toml` | cargo | manifest | **excluded** (`fixture`) |
| `dev/release/fixtures/cargo-skew/mock-skew-consumer-b/Cargo.toml` | cargo | manifest | **excluded** (`fixture`) |
| `dev/release/fixtures/pip-skew/api-v1/setup.py` | pypi | manifest | **excluded** (`fixture`) |
